    "advancement": {},
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You gain the following benefits.</p><p><strong>Inspiring Strike.</strong> Once per turn, when you score a Critical Hit against a creature, you can choose an ally within 30 feet of yourself who can see or hear you and who lacks Heroic Inspiration. That ally gains Heroic Inspiration.</p><p><strong>Reassert Honor.</strong> When an enemy you can see deals damage to one of your allies within 5 feet of you, you have Advantage on your next attack roll against that enemy before the end of your next turn.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-EgtDPHUTFORFA0eX\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>Give Heroic Inspiration on the ally’s sheet; roll the attack with Advantage yourself for Reassert Honor.</p></section>",
